#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:2
msgid "lmcache tool"
msgstr "lmcache tool"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache tool`` command groups offline analysis utilities bundled "
"with LMCache."
msgstr "``lmcache tool`` 命令将与 LMCache 捆绑在一起的离线分析工具进行分组。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:11
msgid ""
"Three tools are available: ``cache-simulator`` replays lookup logs, "
"``transfer-channel-benchmark`` measures peer-to-peer read throughput, and"
" ``flamegraph`` profiles any running process."
msgstr "提供了三个工具：``cache-simulator`` 重放查找日志，``transfer-channel-benchmark`` 测量点对点读取吞吐量，以及 ``flamegraph`` 记录任何正在运行的进程。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:17
msgid ""
"``cache-simulator`` depends on the optional ``plot`` extras "
"(``sortedcontainers`` / ``matplotlib``). If they are not installed, the "
"sub-command is silently omitted from the CLI. Install the extras to "
"enable it."
msgstr ""
"``cache-simulator`` 依赖于可选的 ``plot`` 附加组件（\\ ``sortedcontainers`` / "
"``matplotlib``\\ ）。如果它们未安装，子命令将会在 CLI 中静默省略。安装附加组件以启用它。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:24
msgid "cache-simulator"
msgstr "cache-simulator"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:26
msgid ""
"Replay LMCache lookup-hash JSONL logs through an LRU cache to measure the"
" KV-cache token hit rate. It has three actions:"
msgstr "通过 LRU 缓存重放 LMCache 查找哈希 JSONL 日志，以测量 KV Cache 的令牌命中率。它有三个操作："

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:37
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:38 ../../source/cli/tool.rst:86
#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:133
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:39
msgid "``simulate``"
msgstr "``simulate``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:40
msgid ""
"Replay logs at a fixed cache capacity; print a text report and save a "
"7-panel statistics PNG."
msgstr "在固定的缓存容量下重放日志；打印文本报告并保存 7 面板的统计 PNG。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:42
msgid "``sweep``"
msgstr "``sweep``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:43
msgid ""
"Sweep across a range of cache capacities and save a hit-rate vs. capacity"
" PNG."
msgstr "在一系列缓存容量中进行扫描，并保存命中率与容量的 PNG 图像。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:45
msgid "``gen-dataset``"
msgstr "``gen-dataset``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:46
msgid ""
"Generate a ``vllm bench serve`` custom dataset (JSONL) from lookup-hash "
"JSONL logs, preserving prefix-sharing structure."
msgstr "从查找哈希 JSONL 日志生成一个 ``vllm bench serve`` 自定义数据集 (JSONL)，保留前缀共享结构。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:49
msgid "Each action has its own flags. Run the built-in help for the full list:"
msgstr "每个操作都有其自己的标志。运行内置帮助以获取完整列表："

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:59
msgid "transfer-channel-benchmark"
msgstr "transfer-channel-benchmark"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:61
msgid ""
"Measure read throughput (GB/s) of the LMCache transfer channel "
"(``lmcache/v1/distributed/transfer_channel/``) for batched peer-to-peer "
"reads. It allocates the transferred objects through the same "
"``L1MemoryManager`` production uses, so it exercises the real memory path"
" rather than raw tensors."
msgstr "测量 LMCache 传输通道（``lmcache/v1/distributed/transfer_channel/``）的读取吞吐量（GB/s），用于批量点对点读取。它通过与生产使用的相同 ``L1MemoryManager`` 分配传输的对象，因此它测试真实的内存路径，而不是原始张量。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:67
msgid ""
"The benchmark runs as **two processes**, a ``server`` that registers a "
"source buffer and serves its object catalog, and a ``client`` that reads "
"a subset of those objects and reports throughput:"
msgstr "基准测试以 **两个进程** 运行，一个 ``server`` 注册源缓冲区并提供其对象目录，另一个 ``client`` 读取这些对象的子集并报告吞吐量："

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:85 ../../source/cli/tool.rst:131
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--role {server,client}``"
msgstr "``--role {server,client}``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:88
msgid ""
"Required. ``server`` registers the source buffer; ``client`` reads from "
"it and reports throughput."
msgstr "必填。``server`` 注册源缓冲区；``client`` 从中读取并报告吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:90
msgid "``--transfer-channel-type``"
msgstr "``--transfer-channel-type``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:91
msgid "Transfer channel implementation to benchmark (default: ``nixl``)."
msgstr "将传输通道实现用于基准测试（默认：``nixl``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:92
msgid "``--url``"
msgstr "``--url``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:93
msgid ""
"Server: bind address. Client: the server's advertise URL to read from "
"(default: ``127.0.0.1:7600``)."
msgstr "服务器：绑定地址。客户端：要读取的服务器广告 URL（默认：``127.0.0.1:7600``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:95
msgid "``--buffer-size``"
msgstr "``--buffer-size``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:96
msgid "Server: total registered L1 source buffer, e.g. ``8GB``."
msgstr "服务器：总共注册的 L1 源缓冲区，例如 ``8GB``。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:97
msgid "``--object-size`` / ``--page-size``"
msgstr "``--object-size`` / ``--page-size``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:98
msgid ""
"Size of each transferred object and the alignment; must match on both "
"sides."
msgstr "每个传输对象的大小和对齐方式；两侧必须匹配。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:100
msgid "``--num-objects`` / ``--iters``"
msgstr "``--num-objects`` / ``--iters``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:101
msgid "Objects read per iteration, and number of measured iterations."
msgstr "每次迭代读取的对象数量，以及测量的迭代次数。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:102
msgid "``--verify``"
msgstr "``--verify``"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:103
msgid "Check the bytes read against the source after transfer."
msgstr "在传输后检查读取的字节与源的匹配情况。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:105
msgid ""
"The ``--url``, ``--object-size``, and ``--page-size`` values must match "
"between the two processes. Run either side with ``--help`` for the full "
"list, including the client's own ``--listen-url`` and the catalog "
"``--control-url``."
msgstr "``--url``、``--object-size`` 和 ``--page-size`` 的值必须在两个进程之间匹配。运行任一侧并使用 ``--help`` 获取完整列表，包括客户端自己的 ``--listen-url`` 和目录的 ``--control-url``。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:112
msgid "flamegraph"
msgstr "火焰图"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:114
msgid ""
"Attach a profiler to an already-running process, record for a fixed "
"duration, and render a flame graph to find its bottlenecks."
msgstr "将分析器附加到已运行的进程，记录固定时间，并渲染火焰图以查找瓶颈。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:117
msgid ""
"It gives one unified interface over widely adopted profilers (``py-spy``,"
" ``perf``, and ``bcc``), each producing a flame graph. A single "
"``--mode`` spans the whole spectrum, from Python and GIL contention to "
"CPU time, kernel frames, and blocked time: you pick a mode by what you "
"want to see rather than which tool to run, and get consistent output, "
"defaults, and permission checks across all six. It wraps these tools "
"rather than replacing them (it names what to install, it does not install"
" it), so a user or developer can find a pain point or a resource-heavy "
"code path without stitching the tools together by hand."
msgstr "它提供了一个统一的接口，支持广泛采用的分析工具（``py-spy``、``perf`` 和 ``bcc``），每个工具都生成一个火焰图。单个 ``--mode`` 涵盖了整个范围，从 Python 和 GIL 争用到 CPU 时间、内核帧和阻塞时间：您可以根据想要查看的内容选择模式，而不是根据要运行的工具，从而在所有六个工具中获得一致的输出、默认值和权限检查。它包装这些工具而不是替换它们（它指定要安装的内容，而不实际安装），因此用户或开发者可以找到痛点或资源密集型代码路径，而无需手动将工具拼接在一起。"

#: ../../source/cli/tool.rst:132
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

